{"id":23525,"author":"Rezachi","body":"I was banned on \u003cb\u003eNovember 28, 2014 \u003c/b\u003efor apparent\u003cu\u003e Anti- Knockback.\u003c/u\u003e I Didn't appeal then because I Had To Stop Playing Minecraft And Gaming In General Due To Family issues, and forgot to appeal until now. I Currently, from my memory, have a donor rank on avicus. My Reason Why Is Looked Like I Had Anti-Knockback was,\u003cb\u003e\u003c/b\u003e I was in a hotel in San Fransisco and the internet was very bad. If you wanted better internet you had to pay 20 dollars or more. I had the basic internet that came with the stay and My\u003cb\u003e Ping\u003c/b\u003e was \u003cb\u003e1000+ \u003c/b\u003eand my \u003cb\u003eFPS\u003c/b\u003e was at about \u003cb\u003e5.\u003c/b\u003e I'm sorry I couldn't make this appeal any sooner.\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e~\u003cb\u003e\u003cu\u003eMistPvP\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/b\u003e","body_tagged":"I was banned on \u003cb\u003eNovember 28, 2014 \u003c/b\u003efor apparent\u003cu\u003e Anti- Knockback.\u003c/u\u003e I Didn't appeal then because I Had To Stop Playing Minecraft And Gaming In General Due To Family issues, and forgot to appeal until now. I Currently, from my memory, have a donor rank on avicus. My Reason Why Is Looked Like I Had Anti-Knockback was,\u003cb\u003e\u003c/b\u003e I was in a hotel in San Fransisco and the internet was very bad. If you wanted better internet you had to pay 20 dollars or more. I had the basic internet that came with the stay and My\u003cb\u003e Ping\u003c/b\u003e was \u003cb\u003e1000+ \u003c/b\u003eand my \u003cb\u003eFPS\u003c/b\u003e was at about \u003cb\u003e5.\u003c/b\u003e I'm sorry I couldn't make this appeal any sooner.\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e~\u003cb\u003e\u003cu\u003eMistPvP\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/b\u003e","created_at":1469865388,"title":"MistPvP's Ban Appeal","replies":[{"id":325638,"author":"GrapeSmoothie","body":"\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvet